{"4020970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Were There -君はそこにいた-", "steam_appid": 4020970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/ecf3e74da52db6b33e68d1bcd5bdf2b4.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself on the ground, losing your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up, you find yourself in a hallway that you've never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like you're in a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you stand up, you see a girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/e314e378c238eca0fcb77e312081f953.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you try to ask her something, she runs off as if she's fleeing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You chase after the girl, and set off to unravel the mystery of this situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It's a short game with a play time of about 2 hours)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/3e07d1cd78185ee0592e84d495c964f3.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/c999fc733a631f2acf7a6912d23392ca.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/a32ec6ecae85a5e02a3fbed0e2f4806d.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The actions of the main character &quot;boy&quot; include running, walking, jumping, picking up items, crawling underwater, falling, and sometimes fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/ea98c4378896a3ca8f1851c920391e41.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I feel like I'm about to fall, I crawl back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/7bb4d3877c8003f40ae81b4259f2ce1b.avif?t=1760305447\" width=232 height=360 /></span>Passing through the gap...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/7c529bcb95094bb9f01dd7ee6a03a29b.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you can help the girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/b937355840b2acd5b736cfa37b6b8797.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious enemies attack...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We decipher the present from various situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will be revealed in the end...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This action-adventure game lets you control the boy to improve his relationship with the girl, understand the current situation, and unravel the mystery of this situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/ecf3e74da52db6b33e68d1bcd5bdf2b4.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself on the ground, losing your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you wake up, you find yourself in a hallway that you've never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like you're in a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you stand up, you see a girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/e314e378c238eca0fcb77e312081f953.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you try to ask her something, she runs off as if she's fleeing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You chase after the girl, and set off to unravel the mystery of this situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(It's a short game with a play time of about 2 hours)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/3e07d1cd78185ee0592e84d495c964f3.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020970/extras/c999fc733a631f2acf7a6912d23392ca.avif?t=1760305447\" width=512 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.